commit 0a0df14eae57a20ad4c8a79f6d16c9f866508eb9
Author: ledger <ledger@example.invalid>
Date:   Mon Nov 23 02:01:31 2026 +0000

    Add a tasks board for the committee
    
    One section per person so everyone can find what's theirs (minutes 12 Nov),
    tasks with nobody's name first (shed gutter, water meter), overdue and
    due-within-a-week marked, done tasks folded away (Tomas), and the polytunnel
    watering rota at the top where it can be seen at the gate (Dot).
    
    board.py: the events settings group rows by a date and fold away past
    sections, which would fold every person away, so a section with no "date"
    now builds a task board instead. Also: "done"/"Done" and "priya"/"Priya" are
    treated as the same, because the spreadsheet export mixes them and the page
    is rebuilt from each week's export rather than cleaned up by hand. The events
    board builds byte-for-byte the same as before.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

